sitting three feet away from him. Earlier that day, NPR had requested an interview. So I was

00:43:37.280 --> 00:43:43.040
called to the warden's office to sign a release. And this murder for hire guy says,

00:43:43.040 --> 00:43:48.240
Did you hear they called Kiriyaku to the warden's office? It's because he's a rat.

00:43:48.240 --> 00:43:52.640
And he's down there ratting all of us out. Well, you call somebody a rat and blood's

00:43:52.640 --> 00:43:57.520
