00:43:58.160 --> 00:44:04.000
did you hear that son of a gun just called you a rat? And I said an hour ago, I heard him call

00:44:04.000 --> 00:44:10.320
you a child molester, which was totally untrue. But one of the things in my book is always have

00:44:10.320 --> 00:44:16.800
