00:47:19.520 --> 00:47:24.240
trying to figure out the Vietnam War. He went to my father and he said,

00:47:24.240 --> 00:47:30.400
my father had gone with his brother, John Kennedy, when my uncle Jack was a senator.

00:47:31.680 --> 00:47:36.480
