00:50:11.840 --> 00:50:17.520
you've chosen a difficult path, but I'm glad somebody did. I only wish that I had had the

00:50:17.520 --> 00:50:23.360
courage to do it. Wow. And that meant so much to me that I saved it. It was motivating.

00:50:23.920 --> 00:50:28.960
Well, I'll tell you something. Anthony Fauci said something just like that to me at one point,

00:50:28.960 --> 00:50:35.440
believe it or not, 2016 when I went to see him. And I'm sure he would take it back right now

00:50:36.720 --> 00:50:42.320
and take it back many times since. Wow. That's dramatic. Anyway, go ahead and finish what

00:50:42.320 --> 00:50:48.080
you were saying. You know, we've got things like Facebook and Twitter and things like that.

00:50:48.080 --> 00:50:52.720
So CIA people can still stay in touch with me and not have to pass it through

00:50:52.720 --> 00:50:59.600
CIA security and report contact with John. So it's worked out nicely. I still stay in touch with

00:50:59.600 --> 00:51:06.080
a dozen or so former colleagues. Before my father was killed, you know, his first instinct

00:51:06.080 --> 00:51:10.720
when his brother was killed the day I was at school and I was brought home from school

00:51:10.720 --> 00:51:15.440
that day or early. And when I got home, my father was walking in the yard with John

00:51:15.440 --> 00:51:21.040
McCombe, who was the director of the CIA and brought him. The CIA, you know, we lived in McLean,

00:51:21.040 --> 00:51:26.480
so we were only a half mile from Langley. And McCombe came over. McCombe used to come to our

00:51:26.480 --> 00:51:31.520
house every day after work and go for a swim in the pool. And he would often come on his

00:51:31.520 --> 00:51:37.600
lunch break to eat lunch with my dad. My dad called him up and they had brought in McCombe

00:51:38.480 --> 00:51:44.640
after they fired Dallas. And McCombe was a very pious Catholic. He was a Republican.

00:51:44.640 --> 00:51:50.400
He was a very pious Catholic. And my father asked him the first thing he said is, did our people

00:51:50.400 --> 00:51:55.840
do this? That was his first reaction about his brother's death. And but before he died, that was

00:51:55.840 --> 00:52:03.680
63. My father then runs for president in 68. He was asked about like Pete Hamill, who was one of

00:52:03.680 --> 00:52:09.040
the reporters was covering him, who was also a confound. And Pete Hamill asked him a week

00:52:09.040 --> 00:52:16.160
before he died, he said, What are you? What are you going to do about the CIA? And my father said,

00:52:16.160 --> 00:52:20.640
he said the only way. And of course, there's a famous story that my uncle and, you know,

00:52:20.640 --> 00:52:29.600
Alan Dallas lied to him and Bissell and Caddell had lied or Charles Caddell had the three guys

00:52:29.600 --> 00:52:35.040
they fired and lied to him about the Bay of Biggs to try to, you know, because they said,

00:52:35.040 --> 00:52:40.240
yeah, the whole island's going to rise up and go after Castro overthrow him as soon as they hear

00:52:40.240 --> 00:52:45.760
about the Bay of Biggs. They knew that was a lie. And they thought if we can get those guys on land,

00:52:45.760 --> 00:52:50.400
President Kennedy is a young guy and he's going to, he's not going to be able to tolerate

00:52:50.400 --> 00:52:56.240
politically their defeat. So he'll send in the Essex, the aircraft carrier. And that will do

00:52:56.240 --> 00:53:00.480
the work of wiping out Castro. And he refused. He told him I'm not going to involve the U.S.

00:53:00.480 --> 00:53:06.400
military. The U.S. government is not going to attack a sovereign nation. That's right. And so

00:53:07.440 --> 00:53:13.760
in the middle of the night, my uncle and the men were dying on the beach and he had to deny the

00:53:13.760 --> 00:53:20.160
mayor cover. My uncle came out and said out to his aides of the Oval Office and he said,

00:53:20.160 --> 00:53:25.520
I want to take the CIA and shatter it into a thousand pieces and scatter it into the wind.

00:53:26.080 --> 00:53:31.360
Yes, indeed. And then he subsequently fired the three top guys and he brought in Macomb.

00:53:32.000 --> 00:53:36.960
My father was asked, and he initially asked my father to run the CIA, but my father didn't

00:53:36.960 --> 00:53:42.320
think it would be right for the brother to be running a secret police organization with all this

00:53:42.320 --> 00:53:49.440
power. Sure. So my father, but it was always at the top of his mind. How do you, what do

00:53:49.440 --> 00:53:54.720
you do about the CIA? Because they become this government, this, you know, this parasitical

00:53:55.680 --> 00:54:02.000
organism that is devouring our democracy, you know, this secret government that is manipulating

00:54:02.000 --> 00:54:09.680
everything and subjecting Americans to this constant barrage of Psyops propaganda in order to

00:54:09.680 --> 00:54:16.400
maintain permanent wars and all of this kind of stuff. So my father said, the only way

00:54:17.120 --> 00:54:22.960
to solve the problem is to separate the clandestine activities, the kind of paramilitary branch

00:54:23.520 --> 00:54:31.120
from the espionage function. And espionage means information gathering. Right.

00:54:31.120 --> 00:54:36.880
And analysis. And that's why the CIA was originally created. It was not supposed to be doing, you

00:54:36.880 --> 00:54:42.160
know, overthrowing governments and fixing elections and running around shooting and torturing people.

00:54:43.120 --> 00:54:50.080
Dulles added that function subsequently through a little tiny loophole. And what happened is the

00:54:50.800 --> 00:54:57.280
paramilitary tail began to wag the espionage dog and the function of the espionage section

00:54:57.840 --> 00:55:04.880
becomes justifying all these, you know, aberrant actions by the clandestine services and then

00:55:04.960 --> 00:55:14.080
creating new actions for them to go. And my father said that the agency that is doing the espionage

00:55:14.080 --> 00:55:19.440
doing the actual information gathering should be looking over the shoulder of the clandestine

00:55:19.440 --> 00:55:26.080
services and holding them accountable and making sure that the blowback does not, the cost of

00:55:26.080 --> 00:55:30.720
the blowback does not exceed all the benefits of the action in the first place and nobody

00:55:30.720 --> 00:55:36.080
does it. There's no accountability. So if he had been elected, that's what he would have done.

00:55:37.520 --> 00:55:40.160
Can you imagine how different the country would be today?

00:55:41.040 --> 00:55:48.480
After 9-11, the CIA's counterterrorism service received a classified supplemental budget. And

